    "# ── Same data as the previous plot, split into Electron | Pion panels ─────\n",
    "# Side-by-side subplots so each species has the full y-range to itself.\n",
    "# Reuses seed_data, eff_data, gnn_eff_data, _rebin_to_gnn, gnn_x/xerr,\n",
