   "source": [
    "## Triplet Seeding + CKF vs Truth Smearing + CKF — Electrons & Pions\n",
    "\n",
    "Compares two CKF configurations using the same `eff_per_particle.json` schema:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Triplet seeding + CKF** — `300_new_direction_vector/eff_per_particle.json`\n",
    "- **Truth smearing + CKF** — `300_new_direction_vector_truth/eff_per_particle.json`\n",
    "\n",
    "Both curves share the native ACTS 40-bin $p_T$ grid (no rebinning needed). Errors are Clopper–Pearson 68% CL.\n",
    "Color = particle (Electron green, Pion orange); marker = method (■ Triplet+CKF filled, ◇ Truth+CKF hollow).\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "/tmp/ipykernel_1911194/230293832.py:47: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n",
      "  eff = np.where(total > 0, passed / total, np.nan)\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Saved: /data/alice/bkuipers/acts/output_examples/CKF_300_mixed_helix_1000_events/clean/eff_seeding_per_species_replot.pdf\n"
     ]
    },
