    "Same per-layer attribution but using the **best KF attempt of every GT particle with at least one attempt** — no matched/unmatched filter. Companion to the UNMATCHED-only view above. Generated alongside the unmatched JSON in a single pass by `attribute_holes_per_layer.py` (same MAX_EVENTS / N_BINS).\n"
   ]
