      "\n",
      "Muon hits-per-particle summary:\n",
      "  radial                                  : <hits> = 15.672  (N=74995)\n",
      "  Ablation-tangend                        : <hits> = 15.673  (N=74995)\n",
      "  global ratio new/old = 0.9999\n"
     ]
