   ],
   "source": [
    "# ── Fake rate vs pT: Triplet seeding vs CKF — TRACK-averaged (pooled) ─────\n",
    "# Companion to the species-averaged plot above. Here the fake rate is pooled\n",
    "# over ALL tracks per bin (sum fakes / sum totals), i.e. track-count weighted\n",
    "# rather than giving each species equal weight. Binned by the native\n",
    "# reconstruction variable of each stage (seed pT for seeding, reco track pT\n",
    "# for CKF), rebinned to the GNN grid. This is the \"global\" fake rate; it is\n",
    "# dominated by whichever species produces the most tracks in a bin.\n",
    "#   Seeding: seeding_fake_rate_per_pt.json  n_total / n_fake   (seed pT)\n",
    "#   CKF:     fake_rate_per_pt.json          n_*_nocut          (reco pT)\n",
    "# Uncertainty: Clopper-Pearson 68% on the pooled fake fraction.\n",
    "\n",
    "with open(DATA_DIR / \"seeding_fake_rate_per_pt.json\") as _f:\n",
    "    _sfr = json.load(_f)\n",
    "with open(DATA_DIR / \"fake_rate_per_pt.json\") as _f:\n",
    "    _fr = json.load(_f)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax_p = plt.subplots(figsize=FIGSIZE)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Triplet seeding (pool seed-pT counts, rebin to GNN grid)\n",
    "_s_n, _s_d = _rebin_to_gnn(np.array(_sfr[\"n_fake\"],  float),\n",
    "                           np.array(_sfr[\"n_total\"], float),\n",
    "                           np.array(_sfr[\"pt_centers\"], float))\n",
    "_s_val = _s_d > 0\n",
    "_s_fr  = np.where(_s_val, _s_n / np.where(_s_val, _s_d, 1), np.nan)\n",
    "_s_lo, _s_hi = _kf_cp_err(_s_n, _s_d)\n",
    "ax_p.errorbar(gnn_x[_s_val], _s_fr[_s_val],\n",
    "              xerr=gnn_xerr[_s_val], yerr=[_s_lo[_s_val], _s_hi[_s_val]],\n",
    "              fmt=METHOD_MARKER_P1[\"seed\"], color=\"#1f3a68\",\n",
    "              markersize=MS_P1, capsize=CAPSIZE, capthick=1,\n",
    "              label=\"Triplet seeding\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Triplet seeding + CKF (pool reco-pT counts, rebin to GNN grid)\n",
    "_c_n, _c_d = _rebin_to_gnn(np.array(_fr[\"n_fake_nocut\"],  float),\n",
    "                           np.array(_fr[\"n_total_nocut\"], float),\n",
    "                           np.array(_fr[\"pt_centers\"], float))\n",
    "_c_val = _c_d > 0\n",
    "_c_fr  = np.where(_c_val, _c_n / np.where(_c_val, _c_d, 1), np.nan)\n",
    "_c_lo, _c_hi = _kf_cp_err(_c_n, _c_d)\n",
    "ax_p.errorbar(gnn_x[_c_val], _c_fr[_c_val],\n",
    "              xerr=gnn_xerr[_c_val], yerr=[_c_lo[_c_val], _c_hi[_c_val]],\n",
    "              fmt=METHOD_MARKER_P1[\"ckf\"], color=\"#c0392b\",\n",
    "              markersize=MS_P1, capsize=CAPSIZE, capthick=1,\n",
    "              label=\"Triplet seeding + CKF\")\n",
    "\n",
    "ax_p.set_xlabel(r\"$p_T$ [GeV]\", fontsize=FONT_AXIS)\n",
    "ax_p.set_ylabel(\"Fake rate\", fontsize=FONT_AXIS)\n",
    "ax_p.set_xlim(0.0, 0.55)\n",
    "ax_p.set_xticks(np.arange(0.1, 0.51, 0.1))\n",
    "ax_p.set_xticks(np.arange(0.05, 0.51, 0.1), minor=True)\n",
    "ax_p.set_ylim(0.0, 1.05)\n",
    "ax_p.tick_params(labelsize=FONT_TICK - 1)\n",
    "ax_p.grid(True, which=\"both\", alpha=GRID_ALPHA)\n",
    "ax_p.legend(fontsize=FONT_LEGEND - 1, loc=\"upper right\", frameon=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Annotation block: lower-left (empty there — both curves are high at low pT).\n",
    "ANNO_ANCHOR = (0.04, 0.22)\n",
    "_anno_box = dict(facecolor=\"white\", edgecolor=\"none\", alpha=0.85, pad=2)\n",
    "_ax, _ay = ANNO_ANCHOR\n",
    "_anno_kw = dict(transform=ax_p.transAxes, va=\"top\", ha=\"left\", bbox=_anno_box)\n",
    "ax_p.text(_ax, _ay,                    r\"$\\mathbf{Generic \\ Detector}$ Simulation\",\n",
    "          fontsize=FONT_AXIS - 3, **_anno_kw)\n",
    "ax_p.text(_ax, _ay -  ANNO_LINE_DY,    \"FATRAS, 300 particles / event\",\n",
    "          fontsize=FONT_AXIS - 5, style=\"italic\", **_anno_kw)\n",
    "ax_p.text(_ax, _ay - 2 * ANNO_LINE_DY, r\"$|\\eta| < 0.15$, track-averaged\",\n",
    "          fontsize=FONT_AXIS - 5, style=\"italic\", **_anno_kw)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig.tight_layout()\n",
    "out = DATA_DIR / \"fake_rate_seeding_ckf_overall_pooled_replot.pdf\"\n",
    "fig.savefig(out, bbox_inches=\"tight\", dpi=DPI)\n",
    "print(f\"Saved: {out}\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fakerate-ckf-gnnavg-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Fake rate vs $p_T$: Triplet seeding + CKF  vs  SegmentGNN  vs  helix\n",
    "\n",
    "Same style as the track-averaged seeding/CKF figure above, with the two **GNN track builders shown as separate curves** (not averaged).\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Triplet seeding + CKF** — pooled (track-averaged) fake rate from `fake_rate_per_pt.json` (`n_fake_nocut / n_total_nocut`), rebinned to the SegmentGNN $p_T$ grid. Binned by reco track $p_T$.\n",
    "- **GNN + SegmentGNN** and **GNN + helix matching** — per-track fake rate read directly from each builder's `matching_df_*.csv` (same per-track definition as `plots.ipynb` cell 36: one entry per reco track, fake iff no row is `is_matched`, binned by the majority particle's truth $p_T$). Self-contained — pulls from `data_300_mixed/track_evaluation/{testset_SegmentGNN,testset_helix}`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Errors are Clopper-Pearson 68% CL."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "fakerate-ckf-gnnavg-code",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Saved: /data/alice/bkuipers/low_pt_gnn_pipeline/data_300_mixed/visuals/track_metrics/fake_rate_ckf_vs_gnn_vs_pt.pdf\n",
      "  overall  CKF: 0.584   SegmentGNN: 0.051   helix: 0.152\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
